{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフールみなさん楽しみましたかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこの日を何日も前から楽しみにしていて、メンバーと車に乗って移動してる時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想像しただけで楽しみすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな静かに音楽聴いたり寝てたりしてたんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフールの嘘を考えすぎて楽しくなって吹き出して笑ってしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなには逆に笑われましたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのぐらい楽しみで、\nそんなエイプリルフール当日の1人目は、\nお兄ちゃんが今日入社式だったので、お兄ちゃんに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフールだから入社式は休みだよーって言ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後、楽屋で かずみんに、家族にうそつきたいんだけど〜って言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虫歯5個できちゃって腫れちゃった！\nって言って画像加工して顔腫れさせて送れば？っていうとても素敵な案を出してくれてそれをしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると家族はまんまと引っかかって本気で心配をしてきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歯は大事よ？美味しいものが食べれるのも歯のおかげなんじゃけ\n大事にせんといけんよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか今すぐ病院に行きなさい！とか\n虫歯について調べたのか\nいろんな虫歯になるとこんな大変なことになるんだよ的なもの文章を送られまして..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は懲りずに歯磨ききらいだもーんっと沢山の嘘をついたんですけど\nだんだん親が可愛そうになり\nほんとうは午後が嘘でした！っていう時間なんでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのに早く嘘でしたって言っちゃいました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると安心して母は泣いてしまったらしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体の事だけは心配だから来年から言わないように！\nと強く言われました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか家族の愛を感じました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも大成功でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真付きで送るとやっぱり現実っぽいですもんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他には隠しカメラを舞台裏に設置し、今日の握手会のペアということもあり\n大好きなまいちゅんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「朝起きたらホテルの枕元にナタデココ並べてあったんだけど！！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と嘘をついて見たんだけどこれは騙されませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その一部始終は755に乗ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの嘘はちーちゃんが協力して嘘を考えてくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいろーんな人に嘘をつきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えばライブでこけて歯が折れちゃった！\nとかとか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ププッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーー！！！めっちゃ楽しかったなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃からハムスター24匹ぐらいに増えたり、\nインコ4匹くらいとか、\nうさぎもちっさいときに飼って、小6とかでウサギを2匹飼ってそっからまた3匹増えたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんもザリガニやお魚、亀、カブトムシも...飼ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬は幼い頃にラブラドールを飼ってたり、\n少し大きくなってミニチュアダックスちゃんがいたり、そして今はタイニープードル..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃からずーっと動物に囲まれて育ったってこともあり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上京してから犬飼いたくて仕方なかったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、家族が来る時にワンちゃんを連れて来てもらったんです。\nペットを飼うのは大変だから、飼いたくなくなれば諦めることができるから、犬の嫌なところを見ようと思って、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、連れて来てもらったら、いいところしか見えなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で飼おう！！！っと思いペットショップに行って犬を決めたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親にちゃんと飼えるのか、今いるワンちゃんを育てて見たら？と言われて、その日から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家にワンちゃんがいるんです！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前はポテト"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はお芋が好きだから！\n昔飼ってたダックスはチョコとチェリー！\n名前の通りそのときに一番好きだった食べ物の名前です。\nうさぎもナスビちゃんっていたけど\n...それも私の好物です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ての通りラブラブですよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうねー可愛くて仕方がない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォルダがポテちゃんだらけ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポテトちゃんでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は大好きなまいちゅんとペアで久しぶりの大阪会場で素敵な皆さんと握手会も出来て、シングル曲全披露もでき最高の1日でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間に感じてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ来てくださった皆さん！本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこれなかったけど行きたかった！ってコメントくれた皆さん！\n気持ち届いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/01/4889833/0015.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}